diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 20fdc15..7144fa4 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,25 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Share ANSI and UTF-16 window-class queries, clipboard formats, global atoms,
+  and mapped-module string resources. Load resource icons and bitmaps through
+  the existing guest GDI image model, including requested image dimensions.
+- Expose the COM task allocator with a guest IMalloc vtable, shared task-memory
+  ownership, per-thread message filter registration, and OLE Automation's
+  documented ordinal aliases and BSTR string entry points.
+- Support binary BSTR byte counts, separately allocated SAFEARRAY descriptors
+  and data, and transfer the ownership of thread-local Automation error objects.
+
+- Bind mapped DLL imports after all configured export tables are visible, and
+  initialize static DLL dependencies before entering their caller.
+- Decode the structured memory operands of x87 environment and register saves.
+- Recover distant switch arms and preserve taken branches across listing gaps;
+  recognize split returning epilogues before inferring calls that never return.
+- Discover callback addresses stored directly into memory fields.
+- Preserve interface adjustors whose shared method body has its own vtable entry.
+- Allow static ports to disable runtime instruction interpretation with
+  `[translate] allow_runtime_interpreter = false`.
+
 - Allow native game adapters to place their own cursors at absolute touch
   positions in logical game pixels. Placement can discard pending DirectInput
   X/Y movement without losing button, wheel or keyboard input.
